					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240020201,
					"content": "Ms. Isadora, is there something I can help you with?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020202,
					"content": "Officer Muirne, I have a question for you. Do you remember the stack of accounts I brought to the office this morning?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020203,
					"content": "I remember that. You were attacked by a flock of Violetgold Angler Gulls as well, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020204,
					"content": "Yes, that's right! Once those annoying gulls flew away, I hurried over to my office.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020205,
					"content": "Do you recall if I left any sheets on the ground when I ran off?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020206,
					"content": "Um... I can't remember. I was also busy with other work at the time...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020207,
					"content": "But if you need them urgently, we can \"reenact\" your path to the office.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020208,
					"content": "Eh? Could you, really? I... don't want to ask too much of you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020209,
					"content": "We're just looking for things — a much easier task than work at the Palais Mermonia, that's for sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020210,
					"content": "I do recall that you had tied the documents you were carrying together into stacks. Is that correct?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020211,
					"content": "That's right. We need to be quite precise with our reports for cost review, after all. You've got a good eye, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020212,
					"content": "Everything has to be listed, from large tasks like getting artisans to maintain the outer walls of the Palais, to small ones like changing a lock on a desk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020213,
					"content": "That's how every month's expenses come up to a thick bundle that needs rope to tie together.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Isadora"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020214,
					"content": "In short, there's no way that a single sheet might have just flown off by itself — even though you had lost documents, you would have lost them stack by stack.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240020215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				},
				{
					"id": 240020215,
					"content": "It hasn't been long since you got to the office, so let's set off now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Muirne"
				}
			]
		},
